







#lg A	sa-gida


@(A.A.1 = 1-8) While I, the lady, was passing the day yesterday, while I, @wDN{Inana}, was passing the day yesterday, while I was passing the day, while I was dancing, while I was singing songs all day until evening, he met me, he met me. The lord, the friend of @wDN{An}, met me; the lord took me in his hands, @wDN{Ušumgal-ana} embraced me about my neck.

@(A.A.9 = 9-12) @q[Inana,Dumuzid]{“……, let me go, so that I can go to our house! Friend of @wDN{Enlil}, let me go, so that I can go to our house! What lie can I offer to my mother? What lie can I offer to my mother @wDN{Ningal}?”}

@(A.A.13 = 13-22) @q[Dumuzid,Inana]{“Let me teach you, let me teach you! @wDN{Inana}, let me teach you the lies of women: @q{“My girlfriend was dancing with me in the square. She ran around playfully with me, banging the drum. She sang her sweet songs for me. I passed the day there with her in pleasure and delight.”} Offer this as a lie to your own mother. As for us -- let me make love with you by moonlight! Let me loosen your hairgrip on the holy and luxuriant couch. May you pass a sweet day there with me in voluptuous pleasure.”}

#trailer rubric	sa-gida


@(A.A.23 = 23) @fsux{Sa-gida}.

#lg B	sa-jara


@(A.B.24 = 24-26) @q[Inana,Dumuzid]{“I the maiden, in the streets and alleys, ……, by day I …… with you,”}  @gap{1 line fragmentary}   @gap{approx. 11 lines missing} 


#lg B	sa-jara


#etcsl#linkGrpo
#etcsl#link type=section t40808.sec1 t40808.sec2
#etcsl#linkGrpc

@(B.B.1 = 1-12)  @gap{1 line fragmentary}   @gap{1 line unclear}  There he is, standing at our mother's gate, while I am rushing around in excitement. There he is standing at @wDN{Ningal's} gate, while I am rushing around in excitement. Oh that someone would tell my mother! May our neighbour come to sprinkle water on the floor! Oh that someone would tell my mother @wDN{Ningal}! May our neighbour come to sprinkle water on the floor: the fragrance of her dwelling is pleasant, and her words are delightful.

@(B.B.13 = 13-20) My lord is perfect for the holy embrace. @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana}, the son-in-law of @wDN{Suen}, Lord @wDN{Dumuzid}, is perfect for the holy embrace. @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana}, son-in-law of @wDN{Suen}, my lord: how pleasing is your lavishness, and how sweet-tasting are your green plants from the plain! @wDN{Ama-ušumgal-ana}, how pleasing is your lavishness, and how sweet-tasting are your green plants from the plain!

#trailer rubric	sa-jara


@(B.B.21 = 21) @fsux{Sa-ŋara}.

#trailer subscript	tigi


@(B.B.22 = 22) A @fsux{tigi} of @wDN{Inana}.



